    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkitanapat naaipirta nkitalaat oo nyamin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Te nepurroo oltung'ani olkiteng arashu enker, neyieng arashu emir, nelak ninye ilmong'i imiet to lkiteng obo, o nkerra ong'uan te nker nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meeta nchere melak ninye ina toki natupurroyie. Te nemeeta ninye toki, nemiri ninye anaa orrindik, pee elak ina natupurroyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te netumi ina ng'ues natupurroyie ninye ti atua imasaa enyena, aa enkiteng, osikiria arashu enker nelak ninye are te nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te neibung'i olapurroni egilita enkaji kewarie neari metua; ore ilo otaara ninye metua nemeeta iloikop. Kake tenaa dama ekenyua neeta ninye iloikop.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Te neisho oltung'ani inkishu edaa te nkurma anaa te nkurma oo sabibu anaa epalaa enkiteng meshomo ainos enkurma e likae tung'ani meeta nchere pee meitalakuni teina naisul naing'uaa enkurma enye oo sabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te nenya enkima enkop, neibung ilkiku o metaa ore enkanasa nateenaki arashu enkano naitashe arashu enkurma nabulu einosa enkima, ore ilo oinua enkima nelak pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Te neisho oltung'ani ole latia enye impisai arashu ntokitin metushuma, nepurrorri te nkaji enye, ore te netumi olapurroni, nelak ninye katitin are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te neitu etumi olapurroni, ore ilo openy e nkaji nelotu ataaniki Enkai, aitodolu tenaa ketipika ninye enkaina enye atua intokitin ole latia enye arashu eitu epik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore olomoni pooki opong'oreki, tenaa te nkaraki olkiteng anaa, enkaraki osikiria, anaa enkaraki enker, anaa enkaraki nkilani, arashu pooki toki naimina najoyie oltung'ani, ‘Ninye ena’, neyauni enchankar oo nkaloli pokira dukuya Enkai; ore ilo odung'oki Enkai enkiguana nelaaki katitin are ilo le latia enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Te neisho oltung'ani ole latia enye osikiria arashu olkiteng, arashu enker, arashu ae ng'ues pooki meing'ura, neye, arashu etum olbae, arashu eyae, eitu eduaaya hoo ng'ae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku olmumai to Laitoriani erishata enye pokira pee edoli tenaa ketipika ninye enkaina enye atua imasaa e ilo le latia enye. Nenyorraa olopeny olmumai nemeitalaku enyamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa tenaa ketupurroyioki too nkaik enyena, nelaaki naa ninye olopeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenaa ing'uesi e ntim naatara nchoo ninye eyau shakenisho; nemelak ninye enyamu te ina nataara ing'uesi e ntim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Te neisilenoo oltung'ani ae toki to le latia enye, netum olbae arashu eye metii olopeny, nelak enyamu pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa te netii olopeny te nebo ina kiteng nemelak. Tenaa entoki apa naisilenuoki aasishore nelakieki enatoning'oteki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkitanapat naaipirta olkuaak le tung'ani o nkitanapat e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
