              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu ninye ake eitoipore, ninye enkitoipet to sesen lenye; kainyoo naa eitoipore? Naa te naaishiraki ninye nanu, naning amu kara oloata olng'ur.",
